      "couplet_index": 0,
      "selection_policy": "balanced-v3",
      "selection_score": 99,
      "selection_signals": [
        "contextually-reviewed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "هرگز وجودِ حاضرِ غایب شنیده‌ای؟\nمن در میان جمع و دلم جای دیگر است",
      "author": "سعدی",
      "title": "غزل شمارهٔ  ۶۳",
      "source_url": "https://ganjoor.net/saadi/divan/ghazals/sh63#bn2",
      "source": "ganjoor",
      "language": "fa",
      "rights": "classical-public-domain; reviewed named classical author",
      "source_revision": "34f4ab3e463903f9399d7ca208b9333911389f94",
      "couplet_index": 1,
      "selection_policy": "balanced-v3",
      "selection_score": 99,
      "selection_signals": [
        "contextually-reviewed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "دلبرم در حسن طاق افتاده است\nقسم من زو اشتیاق افتاده است",
      "author": "عطار",
      "title": "غزل شمارهٔ ۲۵",
      "source_url": "https://ganjoor.net/attar/divana/ghazal-attar/sh25#bn1",
      "source": "ganjoor",
      "language": "fa",
